direction: down

cues: "Bit cues, lobby, generators, breath"
sessions: "luxaeterna LightSession per device and per fixture"
fsink: "FixtureSink.send_frame(frame, when)"
devlink: "DeviceLinkSink"
console: "ConsoleFrameSink"
artnet: "ArtNet sink"
arco: "Arco hub"
shroom: "Tuneshroom shows it at when"
strip: "Console strip"
wled: "WLED ESP32"

cues -> sessions: feed_midi and swap, in-process, 0 hops
sessions -> fsink: render_into at 44 Hz, changed frames only
fsink -> devlink
fsink -> console
fsink -> artnet: PLANNED
devlink -> arco: /<dev>/leds
console -> strip
artnet -> wled: Art-Net UDP
arco -> shroom: relayed over o2lite
